# ─── EmailJS Setup ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to https://emailjs.com and create a free account
# 2. Email Services → Add New Service → Select Gmail → Connect your Gmail
#    Copy the Service ID (looks like: service_abc123)
# 3. Email Templates → Create New Template
#    Use these template variables exactly:
#      {{from_name}}   — sender's name
#      {{from_email}}  — sender's email
#      {{subject}}     — subject line
#      {{message}}     — message body
#      {{reply_to}}    — reply-to address
#    Copy the Template ID (looks like: template_xyz789)
# 4. Account → General → Public Key
#    Copy your Public Key (looks like: AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOp)
# 5. Fill in below and restart the dev server
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
